    holes: same count as src subsprites (under 4-connectivity); same relative row/col
      rank ordering of centroids
    hole_shapes: arbitrary shapes with similar diversity as src cavities (mix of rect and
      non-rect). Holes also pack tightly (8-connected merging).
    shape_difference: src subsprite shapes and dst hole shapes MUST be different
    hole_bbox: 1-5 rows x 1-9 cols; area 1-34 pixels [observed]
  placement: src and dst positioned independently on the canvas; their bboxes may spatially
    overlap as long as their pixels don't collide (eval examples show such overlaps)
  transform: identity (k=0, flip=False) in all eval examples [observed]
